          </p>

          <p>
            Where Jocko is competitive is against other no-sucralose dessert-flavor brands. Premium grass-fed isolates such as Legion Whey+ and Transparent Labs land around $2 to $2.50 per 25 g, so Molk is in the same range while offering bolder flavors. You give up isolate purity and published certification in exchange. Our <a href="/legion-protein-powder-review/">Legion review</a> covers one of those competitors.
          </p>

          <p>
            If you are trying to work out whether one shake a day is enough, our <a href="/how-much-protein-do-i-need/">protein needs guide</a> walks through the numbers before you commit to a subscription.
