              <summary><h3>Is Jocko protein powder good?</h3></summary>
              <div class="faq-answer">
                <p>
                  Jocko Molk is a good-tasting whey, casein and egg blend with 22 g of protein and about 2.2 g of leucine per scoop, and no sucralose. It is not especially lean, at about 65 percent protein by weight, and names no sport certification. It suits flavor-first buyers rather than those focused on value or testing.
                </p>
              </div>
            </details>

            <details class="faq-item">
              <summary><h3>How much protein is in Jocko Molk?</h3></summary>
