                </p>
              </div>
            </details>

            <details class="faq-item">
              <summary><h3>What sweetener is in Jocko protein?</h3></summary>
              <div class="faq-answer">
                <p>
                  Jocko uses its own Jocko GOOD Sweetener blend of allulose, Reb M and monk fruit extract in the powders, and Reb M with monk fruit in the shakes. There is no sucralose or aspartame. Allulose does not count toward sugars on US labels and is very low in calories.
                </p>
              </div>
