          <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-white mb-4">The Bottom Line</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Jocko Fuel makes flavor-first protein with a cleaner sweetener system than most mainstream brands. Molk powder gives you 22 g of protein and about 2.2 g of leucine per scoop with no sucralose, the shakes deliver a strong 30 g per bottle, and the Clear Isolate is a pleasant change from milky shakes. None of them comes with a named sport certification, and the powder is less protein-dense than a modern whey.
          </p>
